    "description": "M&T (Mullenbach & Thewald) Allwetter\nBerchtesgaden Carved Hunter's Pipe\nBriar Wood, Metal Windcap, Mid-20th Century\nVintage German Tyrolean-style hunter's pipe (Jagerpfeife) produced by Mullenbach & Thewald under the Allwetter line. The briar bowl features deeply carved folk art relief depicting a stag in an Alpine forest beneath a banner reading \"BERCHTESGADEN\". Designed for outdoor use, it incorporates a slotted metal windcap and a threaded base.\nCarved briar bowl with relief stag motif and Berchtesgaden banner\nStamped \"BRUYERE M&T GARANTIE\" and \"Allwetter 63460\" on shank\nHinged vented metal windcap with attached cord and bead accents\nDetachable dark foot base and angled composite and metal stem\nCondition:\nBriar shows rich patina and minor surface handling wear. Metal windcap exhibits age-appropriate oxidation and tarnishing. Hinged lid and stem components fit securely. Bowl interior shows signs of previous smoking.\nWarehouse Location: Cleveland\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
